                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The jubjub bird is damaged by an attack that deals cold, electricity, fire, or sonic damage</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The jubjub bird takes damage as normal, then gains resistance 20 to the triggering damage type for 1 round. If the triggering attack dealt more than one of the listed damage types, the jubjub bird gains resistance 20 to each of them.</p>"
