                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Jubjub birds grow more frenzied and dangerous as their situation becomes more desperate. The first time the bird's Hit Points are reduced below half of its maximum HP (170 HP), it gains a +1 circumstance bonus to its AC and attack rolls. The first time its Hit Points are reduced below a quarter of its maximum HP (85 HP), the bonus increases to +2, and its Strikes deal an additional 2d6 bludgeoning damage.</p>"
